          "model": "synthetic-demo-assistant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-08",
      "title": "Privacy language without overclaiming",
      "create_time": "2026-09-25T16:00:00.000Z",
      "update_time": "2026-09-25T16:09:00.000Z",
      "message_count": 4,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-08-message-1",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Can I say all data stays on device if the MCP endpoint is a public HTTPS relay?",
          "content_type": "text",
          "create_time": "2026-09-25T16:00:00.000Z",
          "model": null
        },
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-08-message-2",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Be precise: local vault storage and network transport are separate claims. Describe the actual route and avoid promising that payloads never pass through a service until a direct local connection is verified.",
          "content_type": "text",
          "create_time": "2026-09-25T16:03:00.000Z",
          "model": "synthetic-demo-assistant"
        },
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-08-message-3",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "I would rather say less than oversell this.",
          "content_type": "text",
          "create_time": "2026-09-25T16:06:00.000Z",
          "model": null
        },
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-08-message-4",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Use: Your vault is on your computer; you choose which context Maple may read. Then describe the demo transport accurately.",
          "content_type": "text",
          "create_time": "2026-09-25T16:09:00.000Z",
          "model": "synthetic-demo-assistant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-09",
      "title": "A short opening story",
      "create_time": "2026-09-26T16:00:00.000Z",
      "update_time": "2026-09-26T16:09:00.000Z",
      "message_count": 4,
      "messages": [
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-09-message-1",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Draft a simple opening for my talk. I dislike sweeping claims and buzzwords.",
          "content_type": "text",
          "create_time": "2026-09-26T16:00:00.000Z",
          "model": null
        },
        {
          "id": "synthetic-alex-chat-09-message-2",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Every assistant starts by asking me who I am. But my past conversations already contain my preferences, projects, and deadlines. What if I could bring that context with me, and decide exactly what an app is allowed to see?",
